WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.140
Hello Isla, it's Father Christmas here,

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:05.950
calling all the way from the North Pole!

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:10.830
Well, Isla, I've heard all about your wonderful year.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:13.940
Swimming a whole length is no small thing,

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:16.590
so give yourself a proper cheer!

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.830
And a gold star for reading too.

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:22.080
What a clever girl you are!

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:26.920
Helping your little brother tidy up was such a kind thing to do,

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.390
and the elves think so too.

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:35.850
I hear you and your friends Amara and Theo have been having lovely times together.

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:39.560
I know all about your wish for a red bike,

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:42.930
and it's tucked safely in my big book.

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:46.450
Mrs Christmas and Rudolph send their love.

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:52.200
Do be kind to everyone, and remember to get tucked up in bed on Christmas Eve.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:57.590
Don't forget a mince pie for me and a carrot for Rudolph!

00:00:57.780 --> 00:00:59.890
Merry Christmas, Isla!
